Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.85,OP,,0,0,0,,好勝其實是認真的證明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.52,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算這麼說，你也不會相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:48.06,OP,,0,0,0,,所謂的常識，有時只是枷鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.77,OP,,0,0,0,,正因為未知，才更值得去挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.36,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士，還是路邊的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.86,OP,,0,0,0,,為了找到答案，我選擇迎戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:05:01.16,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃燒的熱情如閃電般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.74,OP,,0,0,0,,無論你變成什麼模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:11.04,OP,,0,0,0,,並肩作戰的意志絕不動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:15.88,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:21.13,OP,,0,0,0,,只為遇見令人熱血沸騰的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:28.02,OP,,0,0,0,,來吧，用刀鋒指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:33.19,OP,,0,0,0,,喚醒內心溫柔的強悍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:38.07,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸騰燃燒的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:42.49,OP,,0,0,0,,將絕望的氣息一刀斬斷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.41,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用這把“真劍”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:28.12,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷電擊中，內心翻騰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:36.04,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的預感，第一次在心底悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.63,ED,,0,0,0,,努力過後的冰淇淋獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.68,ED,,0,0,0,,在特別的日子裡分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.55,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此擺出美味的神情對視
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.64,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.48,ED,,0,0,0,,這些閃閃發光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.61,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:03.74,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在許願，像是在祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:07.45,ED,,0,0,0,,細細地品味每一個瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:11.37,ED,,0,0,0,,在樸素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地點綴色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:19.38,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法，離不開你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.22,ED,,0,0,0,,這股讓人無法抗拒的悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,自古以來，這個世界就存在著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,足以撼動天地的強大之劍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那些劍曾無數次擦出激烈火花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,讓世界陷入混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但隨著和平降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它們的存在也逐漸被遺忘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然而，時代來到現代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有兩個追求力量的少年現身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因為他們命中注定的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那沉睡的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如今將再次甦醒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚啦，來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吼！凹嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣真的會有獵物上鉤嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐也是修行的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你就這樣撐著，總有一天會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧，影虎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,叢林之王也不過如此嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,庄之介
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸，我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我終於打倒叢林之王啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-故意露出破綻\N-成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-等對方上鉤再一擊命中\N-成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,完全照計劃走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哼，面對大猩猩也能輕鬆獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因為這裡可是叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,弱肉強食就是大自然的法則
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-撤退\N-呦呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他們好像還沒發現我們的存在耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想試試看被食物包圍\N並住在裡面是什麼感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好，那我們趁現在快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,動作快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,（成田國際機場）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,日本航空5701班機即將抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加，你特地來接我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你在劍道亞洲大賽奪冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,超厲害的，根本已經萬夫莫敵了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,還有那傢伙…還有鐵劍十郎在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不打倒那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不能稱作真正的冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,爸…爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊，刃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,修行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,修行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你還挺強的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，你也是武士嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我問你是誰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鐵刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是武士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你又是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫峰沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是女生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,女…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是女人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好酷…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的褲子好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,女…女人好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（國際線出發 鐵路）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,劍…劍十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,雷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我等這天等很久了，劍十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-我們今天做個了結吧\N-快點，雷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-刃，過來\N-好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，計程車
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,刃，從今天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡就是你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是我家！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-等一下，你給我站住\N-超讚的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰？哪來的小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放開我，你這狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看來這小鬼不懂什麼禮貌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天就來教你什麼叫真正的劍道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,劍道是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿成這樣，還敢說不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,劍十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我們只是暫時借住一下罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要擅自決定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你也該有點分寸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,劍十郎，你跑來這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆婆，你還活著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸，你跟這隻狒狒認識嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是劍十郎的崽子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那我可得好好教訓你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,崽子是什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要教訓他啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-面…\N-胴…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-面！\N-胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-面！\N-哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好帥喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好多武士耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要找誰當對手好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}-好痛\N-好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，選這傢伙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他…他是這間道館最強的武藤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼，你有這麼強嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟那傢伙比賽嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,相對的，如果刃贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你們就要讓我住在這個家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他才贏不了咧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-武藤，你跟這傢伙打一場\N-咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不必手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那邊嘀咕什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快點開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就因為這樣\N我才不喜歡大猩猩跟狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你這小鬼竟敢對老師…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼，你不用穿護具嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸說那是弱者才需要穿的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我從來沒輸給大猩猩過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方就位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,還真的不是只會嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那揮法還挺銳利的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不過他揮太大力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,劍路一眼就看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好強
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}根本打不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼啦，小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要休息嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有時間讓你休息啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡，動作還真靈活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你…在叢林裡應該也能活下來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡可不是叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,叢林…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，我記得他們那時候是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，別慌張
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出來嗎？那傢伙破綻百出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不過是隻被逼急的老鼠在掙扎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在砍獵物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是在砍氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好大的力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶，贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這…這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然靠直覺就砍贏了武藤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這劍法也太亂來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那這陣子就多多指教囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你也差不多該安定下來了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜歡自由自在\N這才符合我的性情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,弱肉強食，這可是自然的法則
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡又不是叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,夠了，你知道現在幾點嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太陽早就升起來了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐好了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你給我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很在意一件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼家裡會有老虎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,牠是我的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在叢林的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這怎麼這麼難抓？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎樣？別來礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就吃了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛？原來你是在幫忙嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是個好老虎耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,從那時開始，影虎就成了我夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼夥伴…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來，劍十郎去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上還沒看到他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,欸，你看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,“我出去一下，剩下的拜託了”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這是他寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙…竟然丟下兒子…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他在叢林裡常常這樣自己跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，很像他會做出來的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的菜不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,還不是因為你吃太慢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,被搶走也不能怪別人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是自然的法則
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加，你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你不要跟來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要去學校
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,學校是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是大家聚在一起學習的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,學習？是在修行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那裡應該有很多強者囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以到底有沒有啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎麼整你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯，那邊有超多超強的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你這種小咖一下子就會被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,這…這麼強嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能嘛？笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧，沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定會保護你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此，裡面有很多強者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那個…刃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,其實…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手都在發癢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}這…這個家怎麼在叫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,都說了這個不是家，是學校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,原來學校是會叫的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟沙也加是什麼關係？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,叫什麼名字？幾歲？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好多女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我等一下有早上的訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在就給我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行\N-咦？為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才不是說了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡有很多強的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這樣\N我怎麼可能丟下你自己回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知…知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你聽好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要乖乖待在旁邊看喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟沙也加家一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡也有超多武士耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我先去換衣服，你乖乖待在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,換衣服？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我簡直要發瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨，小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你好辣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪？怎麼一點都不開心？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸明明說這樣對方會很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太奇怪了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,給我滾出去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然會蠢到誤以為他人還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙果然是個怪咖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，那傢伙超怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是道場的東西，不准亂碰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,完全感受不到他的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙很強嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？他當然強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是全國大賽冠軍耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你來跟我打一場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我要跟你這種人…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,凹嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚啦，來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凹嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗚啦，來這邊，嗚啦…\N-你這個搞笑小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有破綻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,別鬧了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡可不是小鬼的遊樂場所
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你還真強
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鐵刃，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我嗎？我是鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸猛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是刃與他永遠的宿敵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸猛之間的第一次相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫峰沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,3月3日生，14歲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是峰道場中的獨生女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,現在正努力修行中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得下週會發生不得了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,下集，甦醒的風神劍之卷
